    <id>http://arxiv.org/abs/1505.06580v4</id>
    <title>On numerical semigroups closed with respect to the action of affine maps</title>
    <updated>2016-03-20T22:45:41Z</updated>
    <link href="https://arxiv.org/abs/1505.06580v4" rel="alternate" type="text/html"/>
    <link href="https://arxiv.org/pdf/1505.06580v4" rel="related" type="application/pdf" title="pdf"/>
    <summary>In this paper we study numerical semigroups containing a given positive integer and closed with respect to the action of an affine map. For such semigroups we find a minimal set of generators, their embedding dimension, their genus and their Frobenius number.</summary>
